# Google Maps API key for the ADMIN DASHBOARD — enables current satellite
# imagery in the map pickers.
#
# Without it the maps still work, falling back to Esri World Imagery, whose
# capture over מעלה אדומים is from 2024-07 and therefore shows newer
# neighbourhoods (הר הלבונה and later) as bare ground.
#
# Setup:
#   1. Google Cloud console → enable "Map Tiles API"
#   2. Create an API key
#   3. Restrict it: Application = HTTP referrers (the admin's domain)
#                   API         = Map Tiles API only
#   4. Copy this file to .env and paste the key below
#
# This key is web-only. The mobile app needs its OWN key from the same project,
# restricted to the Android package + SHA-1 — one Google key can carry only one
# application restriction type. Never share a key across the two.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_KEY=
